  ('20556140-3343-5179-a6cb-ab4a8047d6f0', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-argument-evidence'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which evidence does the author give to support the reason that many students have nowhere quiet to work?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Visitors call the reading corner the friendliest room in the building.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"In a survey, 64 percent of students said their homes are noisy in the afternoon.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The school already pays to heat the building until six o'clock.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Late homework at Corbin Middle School dropped by nearly a third.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In a survey, 64 percent of students said their homes are noisy in the afternoon.$q$, $q$The survey result about noisy homes appears right after the reason "many students have nowhere quiet to work." The heating detail supports a different reason, that the cost would be small.$q$, 'draft', '7849adca-914b-5525-9f9e-efb71da06e23')
