  ('ffdf989a-a8a1-5e41-bcda-43d6096da81a', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-argument-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the author respond to the claim that students should go home and rest after school?$q$, $q$[{"text":"By pointing out that staying in the library would be a choice, not a requirement.","is_correct":true},{"text":"By arguing that rest is not important for middle school students.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"By giving survey data showing that students are rarely tired.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"By ignoring the claim and moving straight to the conclusion.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$By pointing out that staying in the library would be a choice, not a requirement.$q$, $q$The author writes that "no student would be required to stay," so students who want to rest still can. The author actually agrees that "Rest matters," so the author does not dismiss rest.$q$, 'draft', '7849adca-914b-5525-9f9e-efb71da06e23')
