   $q$What does the author want Pinecrest Middle School to do?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Build a new gym next to the front lawn this spring.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Move all science classes outside for the whole year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Replace half of the front lawn with a garden of native plants.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Water the front lawn more often during the summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Replace half of the front lawn with a garden of native plants.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the school "should replace half of the lawn with a garden of native plants." The gym is mentioned only as a date fact and is not part of the claim.$q$, 'draft', '8746a211-e31f-5ef9-b9c0-c8ab12fc9639')
