   $q$Which phrase signals that the author is about to acknowledge a different viewpoint?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"My point is simpler\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-signal-word"},{"text":"\"The biggest reason\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-signal-word"},{"text":"\"Laptops also bring\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-signal-word"},{"text":"\"To be fair\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"To be fair"$q$, $q$"To be fair" introduces the advantages of typed notes, which is the other side. "The biggest reason" introduces support for the author's own view.$q$, 'draft', '7f6ebf51-da34-5449-9df9-a01fa095b7a1')
