   $q$What is the author's main purpose in the first three paragraphs?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To explain a town's decision and the debate surrounding it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"To argue that the ferry should have stayed in operation.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-opposing-view"},{"text":"To persuade readers to visit the bridge in Millbrook today.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To describe how covered wooden bridges were built long ago.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To explain a town's decision and the debate surrounding it.$q$, $q$The first three paragraphs describe the problem, the arguments on each side, and the vote. The author does not give an opinion until the last paragraph, and never argues for keeping the ferry.$q$, 'draft', '52c5b03d-8bf1-5168-bbee-98d41c30d908')
