  ('10749aff-3dac-56a4-b86a-693121191feb', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g8-character-setting-plot'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What does the beaver's line "You may fish here. There is enough." reveal about him?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He wants her to help him make the dam even higher.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He is proud and wants her to admit that he was right.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"He is generous and does not hold a grudge against her.","is_correct":true},{"text":"He is unsure whether his pond will last much longer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$He is generous and does not hold a grudge against her.$q$, $q$The beaver offers his fish freely, without mentioning their argument. The heron admits her mistake on her own; he never asks her to, so pride is not supported.$q$, 'draft', '1b0c7c86-144b-5240-8826-96be22cda1aa')
