   $q$What do Mina and Fox have in common?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Both lose at first and decide to quit before the contest is finished.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Both are the fastest in their groups and like to boast about their speed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-characters"},{"text":"Both trick their opponents by breaking the rules of the competition.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Both are smaller than their opponents and win by choosing where to compete.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Both are smaller than their opponents and win by choosing where to compete.$q$, $q$Fox picks the bramble wood and Mina picks the crowded lane, places where being small helps. Boasting about speed describes Antelope, not Fox or Mina.$q$, 'draft', 'd115c877-71e0-53e1-805f-4be8d2cf48a6')
