   $q$What can be inferred from Mr. Lindqvist's comment about the outdoor dumpster?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He now has to empty the dumpster more often than before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Less trash was leaving the school than before the program.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The dumpster had been moved behind the school garden.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-detail"},{"text":"He disliked the compost bins and wanted them removed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Less trash was leaving the school than before the program.$q$, $q$If he no longer needs to empty the dumpster twice a week, less trash is filling it. Nothing he says shows he disliked the program.$q$, 'draft', 'b05202f2-b3cd-56fa-8c59-0cb725edb085')
